  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">USAID Kenya Sustainable Transformational and Accessible Water Interventions (STAWI) Mashinani</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This five-year program is set to transform water security across nine arid and semi-arid counties in Kenya: Garissa, Isiolo, Kitui, Makueni, Marsabit, Samburu, Taita Taveta, Turkana, and Wajir. These regions, characterized by their vulnerability to climate change and historical neglect, are crucial for Kenyas economy due to their significant contribution to livestock and tourism.</narrative>
  </description>
